# Scene2-1-1

; ========================================
; ●シーン2-1‐1
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:1_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8
@ShowToastUI Text:"第２部　第１章|#Toast_106|"
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_9_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:在会客厅听完典狱长的讲话后……|#0201Adv06_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们按照规定，<br>回到了分配有各自囚犯编号的，位于地下的房间。|#0201Adv06_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么会变成这样……<br>完全搞不懂啊……|#0201Adv06_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:与我同室的艾玛坐在床上，<br>脸色苍白，垂头丧气的样子。|#0201Adv06_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:魔女，是什么啊……？<br>我们到底会怎么样……|#0201Adv06_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我用余光瞥了艾玛一眼，<br>随即又回到自己的事情上。|#0201Adv06_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我坐在房间里的椅子上，<br>用手机确认【魔女图鉴】的内容。|#0201Adv06_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:刚才只是粗略地看了一遍，<br>我打算再次仔细了解一下这里的规则。|#0201Adv06_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我将各种信息牢记于心。<br>最让我在意的是关于【魔女化】的内容。|#0201Adv06_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我们会因为受到精神压力而加深魔女化程度……<br>　仅此而已，没有更多详情了）|#0201Adv06_Hiro001|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（不管怎么样，我已经成功压抑住了冲动，<br>　接下来只能避免在生活中积攒压力了）|#0201Adv06_Hiro002|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗很冷静呢。<br>真厉害啊。|#0201Adv06_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:——没什么厉害的。<br>还有，别跟我说话。|#0201Adv06_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……对不起。|#0201Adv06_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我努力不去看艾玛，<br>在胸前紧紧握拳。|#0201Adv06_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（在此之外，对我更不利的是<br>　和艾玛长期同处一室的这种环境）|#0201Adv06_Hiro004|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（这必定会给我带来压力。<br>　也许需要想些办法）|#0201Adv06_Hiro005|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（总之，到了放风时间<br>　尽量出去走走会比较好）|#0201Adv06_Hiro006|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我叹了口气，<br>从口袋里掏出刚才发现的另一样东西。|#0201Adv06_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; アイテムスチル：『ヒロの万年筆』表示
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:10-1

[PrintTextModified Text:这是我初中时常用的，<br>本应送给【她】了的钢笔。|#0201Adv06_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（为什么它会出现在这里……？）|#0201Adv06_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然想不通原因，<br>但我正好需要一支笔，倒也算是件好事。|#0201Adv06_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了整理思绪，<br>我习惯每天写日记。|#0201Adv06_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:幸运的是，这个房间里有一个<br>可以用来写字的小本子，<br>我决定从今天开始把它当作我的日记本。|#0201Adv06_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

; さらさらと紙にペンを走らせる書き音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_111 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:首先，我记下了今天发生的事情。<br>随着书写的动作，我的头脑逐渐清晰起来。|#0201Adv06_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸？这个不是希罗以前用的……？<br>|#0201Adv06_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛注意到了我的动作，<br>不由自主地开口问道。|#0201Adv06_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——啧。我不禁咂舌。|#0201Adv06_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:不知怎么就在口袋里了。<br>你那边没有什么东西吗？|#0201Adv06_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:呃，我这边倒是没什么特别的……|#0201Adv06_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛慌张地翻找着自己的口袋。|#0201Adv06_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（为什么偏偏是这支钢笔……）|#0201Adv06_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我握紧钢笔，想着不如折断它了事，<br>但……我还是没能下手。|#0201Adv06_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0201Adv06_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我强迫自己摆脱感伤，继续集中精神写日记。<br>面无表情地，只是机械地移动着笔尖。|#0201Adv06_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; さらさらと紙にペンを走らせる書き音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_111 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:——监狱生活第二轮，第一天。<br>成功回避了死亡，我还活着。|#0201Adv06_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——但看样子，<br>我的魔女化程度似乎正在加深。|#0201Adv06_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——只要避免积攒压力，平静生活下去，<br>应该就不会变得冲动吧。|#0201Adv06_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——魔女化是不是只会逐渐加深？<br>没有什么预防的办法吗？|#0201Adv06_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——留给我的时限到底还有多少……|#0201Adv06_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——为了不堕为魔女，<br>我必须更深入了解这座监牢。|#0201Adv06_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv

